            "title": "LAB-GROWN DIAMONDS",
            "pre-title": "",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "text": "<p></p><p>After decades of research and development, our scientists can now precisely replicate the earth's natural growing process of crystallizing carbon into brilliant, conflict-free diamonds that are chemically, optically, and physically identical to earth-mined diamonds, yet cost 30 to 40 percent less (according to the Federal Trade Commission).</p><p>If you're looking for a stunning and eco-friendly choice, the exquisite brilliance of MiaDonna's lab-grown diamonds is beyond compare.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/collections/lab-created-diamonds\" title=\"Loose Lab-Created Diamonds\">SHOP LOOSE DIAMONDS</a></p><p><a href=\"/blogs/news/how-to-choose-a-lab-grown-diamond\" title=\"How to Choose the Right Lab Grown Diamond\">HOW TO CHOOSE THE BEST LAB GROWN DIAMOND</a></p><p></p>",
