            "pre-title": "",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "text": "<p></p><p>Our non-conflict gemstones are created using the most scientifically advanced processes, resulting in beautiful, precious-cut, Lab-Grown Gemstones in a wide variety of colors and shapes. Chatham produces the world's best rubies, sapphires, emeralds, and alexandrite, with identical physical, optical, and chemical properties to earth-mined gemstones, but at a fraction of the cost</p><p><a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/collections/lab-created-gemstone\" title=\"Loose Lab-Created Gemstones\">SHOP LOOSE GEMSTONES</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/collections/lab-created-gemstone-jewelry\" title=\"Lab Created Gemstone Jewelry\">SHOP GEMSTONE JEWELRY</a></p>",
