    "28e5838d-33a2-486b-8057-cb5133fb7c47": {
      "type": "history-tab",
      "blocks": {
        "b3c18240-421e-47d4-98dc-52f2a17e1dc7": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/MiaDonna_Lab-Grown-Gemstone-Blue-Sapphire-Princess-Cut.jpg",
            "image_alt": "Sapphires",
            "title": "Beyond the Blue",
            "year": "Sapphires",
            "content": "<p>September's birthstone is available in a variety of colors. Famous blue sapphires and dazzling pink sapphires are available in a variety of cuts and sizes. Immensely popular pink sapphires range in hue from champagne to pink champagne to deep pink. Other colors like yellow sapphires are available upon request.</p>"
          }
        },
        "8bda449d-a0e4-4d08-b931-0d7b86910275": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LCG-Ruby-Princess_42ae41ed-9740-4256-94fb-54c6e67ab558.jpg",
            "image_alt": "RUBIES",
            "title": "Passion & Love",
            "year": "RUBIES",
            "content": "<p>July's vibrant red birthstone symbolizes passion, love, and vitality, and is available in various shapes and sizes. Second only to diamonds in terms of hardness, rubies are an excellent choice for jewelry worn daily, like engagement rings.</p>"
          }
        },
        "17715353-fbc1-42d5-afeb-142870a5c506": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LCG-Emerald-Princess.jpg",
            "image_alt": "EMERALDS",
            "title": "So Enchanting",
            "year": "EMERALDS",
            "content": "<p>May's birthstone represents life, growth, harmony, and abundance. As the most popular gemstone for engagement rings, emeralds have enchanted people for centuries. We proudly offer them in a large selection of shapes and sizes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "e5be66f1-0864-4986-8b97-fe38c14891ba": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LCG-Alexandrite-Princess_597bb96b-b7b7-4b3d-af21-a8aa653b56ee.jpg",
            "image_alt": "ALEXANDRITE",
            "title": "Mysterious & Alluring",
            "year": "ALEXANDRITE",
            "content": "<p>Emerald by day, ruby by night, real Alexandrites color changes with the light! June's birthstone varies in color with the light, ranging from green to purply red in hue. While earth-mined Alexandrites are exceptionally rare, our 100% real Alexandrites are readily available in many shapes and sizes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f0d33d60-2544-48e0-b6d8-4220a420e0ab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LCG-Padparadscha-Princess_e6354f67-900b-4ba2-a870-ac4d2caab016.jpg",
            "image_alt": "PADPARADSCHA",
            "title": "Rare & Royal",
            "year": "PADPARADSCHA",
            "content": "<p>The rarest member of the sapphire family, these gemstones are pinkish-orange in color and available in many shapes and sizes. Their name is derived from the Sinhalese word <em>padma radschen, </em>which means lotus blossom.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3c18240-421e-47d4-98dc-52f2a17e1d": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/MiaDonna_Lab-Grown-Gemstone-Blue-Sapphire-Princess-Cut.jpg",
            "image_alt": "Sapphires",
            "title": "LAB GEMSTONES",
            "year": "Sapphires",
            "content": "<p>September's birthstone is available in different hues of blue and pink and a variety of cuts and sizes Immensely popular pink sapphires range in color from champagne to pink champagne to deep pink Other colors like yellow sapphires are avaliable upon reque</p>"
          }
        },
        "8bda449d-a0e4-4d08-b931-0d7b869102": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LCG-Ruby-Princess_42ae41ed-9740-4256-94fb-54c6e67ab558.jpg",
            "image_alt": "RUBIES",
            "title": "LAB GEMSTONES",
            "year": "RUBIES",
            "content": "<p>July's birthstone is vibrant in red and available in various shapes and sizes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "17715353-fbc1-42d5-afeb-142870a5c5": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LCG-Emerald-Princess_6211c4ec-fe7c-41f9-a7aa-43f8ace7b943.jpg",
            "image_alt": "EMERALDS",
            "title": "LAB GEMSTONES",
            "year": "EMERALDS",
            "content": "<p>September's birthstone is available in different hues of blue and pink and a variety of cuts and sizes Immensely popular pink sapphires range in color from champagne to pink champagne to deep pink Other colors like yellow sapphires are avaliable upon reque</p>"
          }
        },
        "e5be66f1-0864-4986-8b97-fe38c14891": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LCG-Alexandrite-Princess_597bb96b-b7b7-4b3d-af21-a8aa653b56ee.jpg",
            "image_alt": "ALEXANDRITE",
            "title": "LAB GEMSTONES",
