          }
        },
        "template--15035832991823__32d6329c-c3f7-4569-8ad3-ff8b742afe21-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "THE DIAMOND HYBRID",
            "pre-title": "",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "text": "<p></p><p>Another stunning option for those seeking conflict-free diamonds, the Diamond Hybrid is the most realistic-looking diamond simulant available, exclusively offered at $295.00 USD per carat. It is created by placing a perfectly cut crystal core into a chamber of intense heat and pressure and infusing Lab-Crown Diamond crystals (bonding them at the molecular level) into the outer layers of the crystal core. The result is a diamond-infused simulant with a non-precious crystal core and a non-porous solid outer layer of Lab-Grown Diamond that will never wear off or detach from the core.</p><p>The Diamond Hybrid is not pure carbon and, therefore, does not share the same properties of a mined or lab-grown diamond. However, the Diamond Hybrid has an outer carbon layer that is molecularly bonded to the non-precious substrate.</p><p>While we will always recommend our Lab-Grown Diamonds, the Diamond Hybrid is an excellent choice for more budget-conscious consumers, especially for jewelry that doesn't receive the wear and tear of regularly worn rings, like earrings and pendants. Our customers often use them as a future diamond placeholder or in their travel jewelry.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/collections/diamond-hybrid\" title=\"Shop Loose Diamond Hybrids\">SHOP DIAMOND HYBRIDS</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/pages/diamond-upgrade-policy\" title=\"Diamond Upgrade Policy\">LEARN ABOUT OUR DIAMOND UPGRADE PROGRAM</a></p><p></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "link": "",
            "button_style": "button--primary",
            "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "alignment": "left",
            "vertical_position": "center"
          }
        }
      },
